{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-project-links",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.55: the PROJECT-domain input database of `project-links`, as the onroad chain mounts it -- the same scale-input-database half of a catalogue as `inputs/washtenaw-project.esm` (read that document for what a domain document declares and why only that), over the same `onroad/default-database.esm`.\n\nWHAT THE DATABASE IS. moves.rs builds it in MariaDB from `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-project-links/setup-project-links.sql` (database `washtenaw_cdb`). Every table above that file's network section is `washtenaw-project`'s SQL unchanged -- the same default-row copies, the same AVFTTool `avft` -- so every table `washtenaw-project.esm` reads from the default database is read from it here too. The SQL states FOUR tables, and tools/build-scale-input-db.py writes them to `inputs/washtenaw-project-links/` typed by the default database's schemas: `link` (three links: 1 on road type 4 at 30 mph and 1 mile, 2 on road type 5 at 25 mph and half a mile, and the off-network link 3 on road type 1), `linkSourceTypeHour` (each on-network link split between source types 21 and 32, differently per link), `offNetworkLink` (the parked fleet of the two source types, with different start and parked fractions) and `opModeDistribution` (the user's START modes 101-108 on the off-network link, the only place a project's start distribution can come from; round fractions that differ from the default `startsOpModeDistribution` by construction).\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES that `washtenaw-project` does not: ProjectTAG's per-link loop on two links and two source types, the link distribution on two road types, brake wear's and tire wear's project paths, ProjectTAG's Starts and StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's PROJECT arm.\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "onroad",
      "domain",
      "project-domain",
      "scale-input-database"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_link": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/Link.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_link"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "output",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "The project's Link: 3 rows, all in county 26161 and zone 261610, grade 0 -- link 1 on road type 4 (1.0 mi, 1,000 veh/h, 30 mph), link 2 on road type 5 (0.5 mi, 600 veh/h, 25 mph) and link 3, the off-network link, on road type 1 with no length, volume or speed. One link per road type, which `run_linkCount` requires. MOVES does not merge the default database's Link into a PROJECT run, so this is the whole table.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_linksourcetypehour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/linkSourceTypeHour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_linksourcetypehour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "4 rows: link 1 is 80% source type 21 and 20% source type 32, link 2 60% and 40%. The default database's has 0 rows, so MOVES's row merge is this table.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_offnetworklink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/offNetworkLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_offnetworklink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows in zone 261610: 1,000 passenger cars (start fraction 0.05) and 400 light commercial trucks (0.08). ProjectTAG's Starts (`st_projectStarts`) on the off-network link.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_opmodedistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/OpModeDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_opmodedistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "32 rows, all on the off-network link 3 at hourDayID 95 and isUserInput 'Y': start modes 101-108 for source types 21 and 32, stated identically for polProcesses 202 and 9102. StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's PROJECT arm copies them to road type 1 (`sod_weight`). Links 1 and 2 have no rows, so LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator computes theirs.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecdomain": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/runspecdomain.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecdomain"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, modelDomain PROJECT, read by tools/build-scale-input-db.py from project-links.xml's `<modeldomain value=\"PROJECT\"/>`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_zoneroadtype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/ZoneRoadType.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputzoneroadtype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "The project's ZoneRoadType: 4 rows, the default's at zone 261610 (tools/build-scale-input-db.py --copy), as in `washtenaw-project`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_hotellingactivitydistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-links/hotellingActivityDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputhotellingactivitydistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The project's hotellingActivityDistribution: 0 rows -- its copy selects zone 261610 from a default table whose rows are all at 990000. In PROJECT domain MOVES does not merge the default's at all (InputDataManager.java:2802-2805), which the model writes as `had_isMerged`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellinghoursperday": {
